<title>DENMARK: Danish shares only slightly hurt by Dow fall.</title>
<headline>Danish shares only slightly hurt by Dow fall.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish share prices looked set at midday Tuesday to defy predictions of steep declines after Monday's falls on Wall Street.</p>
<p>At 1135 GMT the KFX top-20 shares index was down 0.26 from Monday's close at 172.85, a 0.15 percent change.</p>
<p>Its August future was down 0.90, to 172.60. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom + 45-33-969650</p>
